iption_en":"When activated, Time Jump takes your tank 4 seconds into the past to the same position, state, and with the same amount of HP it had.\nTime Jump does not take effect if your tank is destroyed.\n\nThis ability is already installed and can neither be sold nor changed. All other abilities can be obtained only in battle.\n","name_zh-Hans":"时间跃迁","description_zh-Hans":"激活后，时间跃迁将使您的坦克回到4秒前的位置、状态、和血量。\n坦克被击毁后时间跃迁不生效。\n\n此为预装能力且不能出售或更改。所有其他能力仅战斗中可获取。\n"},{"id":38,"stem":"pretendDead","mode":"hellgames","icon":"pretend-dead","category":"radical","tags":["trigger"],"extraEffectDuration":null,"script":{"type":"script","params":{"bonusValues":"","extrasMustBeStopped":"fire hunters_mark_effect curse_effect huntersMarkHellgamesEffect","duration":"15.0","cooldown":"35"}},"displayParams":null,"filter":{"include":[{"tiers":{"min":5,"max":10}}],"exclude":[{"extendedTags":["clip"]}]},"isAbility":true,"name_en":"Play Dead","description_en":"When activated, Play Dead makes your tank look destroyed. The effect lasts while moving, firing, and rotating the turret. Hits, ramming, and falling cause Play Dead to end. Play Dead protects your tank one time against damage from all shells or abilities.\n\nThis ability is already installed and can neither be sold nor changed. All other abilities can be obtained only in battle.\n","name_zh-Hans":"假死","description_zh-Hans":"激活时，假死使你的坦克看起来像被击毁了一样。效果在移动、射击、转动炮塔时仍持续。被击中、撞击、和坠落会导致假死效果结束。假死会为您的坦克抵挡一次炮弹或技能的伤害。\n\n此为预装能力，不能出售或更改。所有其他能力仅战斗中可获取。\n"},{"id":39,"stem":"lightningII","mode":"hellgames","icon":"lightning_2","category":"common","tags":["lightning"],"extraEffectDuration":null,"script":{"type":"script","params":{"startCooldown":"5","cooldown":"6","range":"70.0","damageFactors":"0.45 0.35 0.25","flyTime":"0.2"}},"displayParams":{"damageFactor":"45","damageFactor2":"35","damageFactor3":"25"},"filter":{"include":[{"tiers":{"min":5,"max":10}}]},"isAbility":true,"name_en":"Chain Lightning II","description_en":"Causes damage to 3 enemies in tur